      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef minExtraChar(s: str, dictionary: List[str]) -> int:\n    n = len(s)\n    word_set = set(dictionary)\n    dp = [float('inf')] * (n + 1)\n    dp[0] = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        # treat character s[i-1] as extra\n        dp[i] = dp[i-1] + 1\n        # try to end a word at i\n        for w in word_set:\n            lw = len(w)\n            if i >= lw and s[i-lw:i] == w:\n                dp[i] = min(dp[i], dp[i-lw])\n    return dp[n]\n```",
