      "generated_answer": " with code.```python\ndef minOperations(word: str) -> int:\n    n = len(word)\n    INF = 10**9\n    dp = [[INF]*26 for _ in range(n)]\n    for c in range(26):\n        dp[0][c] = 1 if c != ord(word[0]) - ord('a') else 0\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        for c in range(26):\n            best_prev = INF\n            for p in range(26):\n                if p == c or abs(p - c) == 1:\n                    continue\n                best_prev = min(best_prev, dp[i-1][p])\n            cost = 1 if c != ord(word[i]) - ord('a') else 0\n            dp[i][c] = best_prev + cost\n    return min(dp[n-1])\n```",
