      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef largest_perimeter(nums):\n    nums.sort()\n    # Build prefix sums: prefix[i] = sum of first i elements (i from 0 to n)\n    prefix = [0]\n    for num in nums:\n        prefix.append(prefix[-1] + num)\n    n = len(nums)\n    # Check from the largest possible side down to the third smallest\n    for i in range(n - 1, 1, -1):\n        # Condition: largest side < sum of all smaller sides\n        if nums[i] < prefix[i]:\n            # Return perimeter of the polygon formed by first i+1 sides\n            return prefix[i + 1]\n    return -1\n```",
