    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef longestSemiRepetitiveSubstring(s):\n    n = len(s)\n    left = 0\n    count = 0\n    max_len = 0\n    for right in range(n):\n        if right > 0 and s[right] == s[right-1]:\n            count += 1\n        while count > 1:\n            if s[left] == s[left+1]:\n                count -= 1\n            left += 1\n        max_len = max(max_len, right - left + 1)\n    return max_len\n```",
