      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef can_make_zero(nums, k):\n    n = len(nums)\n    diff = [0] * (n + 1)\n    active = 0\n\n    for i, x in enumerate(nums):\n        active += diff[i]\n\n        if x < active:\n            return False\n\n        need = x - active\n        if need > 0:\n            if i + k > n:\n                return False\n            active += need\n            diff[i + k] -= need\n\n    return True\n```",
