rs.append(j + 1)  # Convert to 1-based indexing\n        \n        # Sort neighbors in ascending order\n        neighbors.sort()\n        \n        # Print neighbors separated by space\n        if neighbors:\n            print(' '.join(map(str, neighbors)))\n        else:\n            print()\n\nsolve()\n```",
