      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef distinctDifferenceArray(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    prefix = [0] * n\n    seen = set()\n    for i in range(n):\n        seen.add(nums[i])\n        prefix[i] = len(seen)\n    suffix = [0] * n\n    seen = set()\n    for i in range(n-1, -1, -1):\n        seen.add(nums[i])\n        suffix[i] = len(seen)\n    diff = [0] * n\n    for i in range(n):\n        suffix_distinct = suffix[i+1] if i+1 < n else 0\n        diff[i] = prefix[i] - suffix_distinct\n    return diff\n```",
