en(nums)\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            first_digit = get_first_digit(nums[i])\n            last_digit = nums[j] % 10\n            if gcd(first_digit, last_digit) == 1:\n                count += 1\n    \n    return count\n```",
