    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "I'll solve this step by step.\n\n## Problem Understanding\n\n1. Takahashi wants to buy N types of products\n2. Each product type i has:\n   - Price per item: P_i yen\n   - Quantity to buy: Q_i items\n3. Shipping fee rules:\n   - If total product cost ≥ S yen: shipping fee = 0 yen\n   - If total product cost < S yen: shipping fee = K yen\n4. Final amount to pay = total product cost + shipping fee\n\n## Step-by-step Solution\n\n### Step 1: Parse the input\n- First line: N (number of product types), S (threshold for free shipping), K (shipping fee)\n- Next N lines: P_i (price per item) and Q_i (quantity) for each product type\n\n### Step 2: Calculate total product cost\n- For each product type i: cost = P_i × Q_i\n- Sum all individual costs to get total product cost\n\n### Step 3: Determine shipping fee\n- If total product cost ≥ S: shipping fee = 0\n- Otherwise: shipping fee = K\n\n### Step 4: Calculate final amount\n- Final amount = total product cost + shipping fee\n\n### Step 5: Output the result\n\n## Implementation\n\n```python\n# Read first line: N, S, K\nN, S, K = map(int, input().split())\n\n# Calculate total cost of products\ntotal_product_cost = 0\nfor _ in range(N):\n    P, Q = map(int, input().split())\n    total_product_cost += P * Q\n\n# Determine shipping fee\nif total_product_cost >= S:\n    shipping_fee = 0\nelse:\n    shipping_fee = K\n\n# Calculate and print final amount\ntotal_amount = total_product_cost + shipping_fee\nprint(total_amount)\n```\n\nLet me verify with the examples:\n\n**Example 1:**\n- N=2, S=2000, K=500\n- Product 1: 1000×1 = 1000 yen\n- Product 2: 100×6 = 600 yen\n- Total product cost: 1600 yen\n- Since 1600 < 2000, shipping fee = 500 yen\n- Total: 1600 + 500 = 2100 ✓\n\n**Example 2:**\n- N=3, S=2000, K=500\n- Product 1: 1000×1 = 1000 yen\n- Product 2: 100×6 = 600 yen\n- Product 3: 5000×1 = 5000 yen\n- Total product cost: 6600 yen\n- Since 6600 ≥ 2000, shipping fee = 0 yen\n- Total: 6600 + 0 = 6600 ✓\n\nThe solution looks correct.",
