    "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef countCompleteSubstrings(word: str, k: int) -> int:\n    n = len(word)\n    # convert to numeric values 0-25\n    vals = [ord(ch) - 97 for ch in word]\n    \n    # precompute 'bad' pairs: 1 if adjacent diff > 2, else 0\n    bad = [0] * (n - 1)\n    for i in range(n - 1):\n        if abs(vals[i] - vals[i+1]) > 2:\n            bad[i] = 1\n    \n    # prefix sums of bad pairs\n    pre_bad = [0] * n\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        pre_bad[i] = pre_bad[i-1] + bad[i-1]\n    \n    ans = 0\n    # try all possible numbers of distinct characters\n    for d in range(1, 27):\n        L = d * k\n        if L > n:\n            continue\n        # frequency counts for current window\n        cnt = [0] * 26\n        good_freq = 0  # number of characters with count exactly k\n        \n        # initial window [0, L-1]\n        for i in range(L):\n            c = vals[i]\n            if cnt[c] == k - 1:\n                good_freq += 1\n            elif cnt[c] == k:\n                good_freq -= 1\n            cnt[c] += 1\n        \n        # check initial window\n        if good_freq == d and pre_bad[L-1] - pre_bad[0] == 0:\n            ans += 1\n        \n        # slide window\n        for left in range(0, n - L):\n            # remove leftmost character\n            c = vals[left]\n            if cnt[c] == k:\n                good_freq -= 1\n            elif cnt[c] == k + 1:\n                good_freq += 1\n            cnt[c] -= 1\n            \n            # add new rightmost character\n            right = left + L\n            c = vals[right]\n            if cnt[c] == k - 1:\n                good_freq += 1\n            elif cnt[c] == k:\n                good_freq -= 1\n            cnt[c] += 1\n            \n            # check current window [left+1, right]\n            if good_freq == d and pre_bad[right] - pre_bad[left+1] == 0:\n                ans += 1\n    \n    return ans\n```",
