      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef max_pairs(words):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the maximum number of disjoint pairs (i, j) such that\n    words[i] == reversed(words[j]) and i < j.\n\n    Parameters\n    ----------\n    words : List[str]\n        List of distinct 2‑letter lowercase strings.\n\n    Returns\n    -------\n    int\n        Maximum number of valid pairs.\n    \"\"\"\n    word_set = set(words)      # for O(1) membership checks\n    used = set()               # strings already paired\n    pairs = 0\n\n    for w in words:\n        if w in used:\n            continue          # already part of a pair\n        rev = w[::-1]          # reverse the two‑letter string\n        # rev must be a different word that exists and is unused\n        if rev != w and rev in word_set and rev not in used:\n            pairs += 1\n            used.add(w)\n            used.add(rev)\n\n    return pairs\n```",
