      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef shortest_subarray(nums, target):\n    n = len(nums)\n    total = sum(nums)\n    \n    # prefix sums: pref[i] = sum of first i elements (i from 0 to n)\n    pref = [0] * (n + 1)\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        pref[i] = pref[i-1] + nums[i-1]\n    \n    # map each prefix sum (for indices 0..n-1) to its index\n    pref_to_idx = {}\n    for i in range(n):\n        pref_to_idx[pref[i]] = i\n    \n    ans = float('inf')\n    for i in range(n):\n        p = pref[i]                 # sum before starting index i\n        needed = p + target\n        q = needed // total        # number of full cycles\n        r = needed % total         # remainder within [0, total-1]\n        if r in pref_to_idx:\n            s = pref_to_idx[r]\n            length = q * n + s - i\n            if length < ans:\n                ans = length\n    return ans if ans != float('inf') else -1\n```",
