ts is 4 + 3 = 7.\n\n \nConstraints:\n\nn == nums.length\nm == queries.length\n1 <= m <= n <= 10^5\n1 <= nums[i] <= 10^5\nqueries[i].length == 2\n0 <= index_i, k_i <= n - 1",
