      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\ndef minimumSeconds(nums: List[int]) -> int:\n    n = len(nums)\n    positions = defaultdict(list)\n\n    for i, x in enumerate(nums):\n        positions[x].append(i)\n\n    ans = n\n\n    for occ in positions.values():\n        m = len(occ)\n        max_gap = occ[0] + n - occ[-1]\n\n        for i in range(m - 1):\n            max_gap = max(max_gap, occ[i + 1] - occ[i])\n\n        ans = min(ans, max_gap // 2)\n\n    return ans\n```",
