      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minOperations(s1: str, s2: str, x: int) -> int:\n    diff = [i for i, (a, b) in enumerate(zip(s1, s2)) if a != b]\n    m = len(diff)\n\n    if m % 2:\n        return -1\n    if m == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    INF = 10**18\n    dp = [[INF] * m for _ in range(m)]\n\n    for length in range(2, m + 1, 2):\n        for l in range(m - length + 1):\n            r = l + length - 1\n            best = INF\n\n            # Pair diff[l] with diff[k]. The subproblems on both sides\n            # are independent for a non-crossing optimal pairing.\n            for k in range(l + 1, r + 1, 2):\n                inside = 0 if l + 1 > k - 1 else dp[l + 1][k - 1]\n                outside = 0 if k + 1 > r else dp[k + 1][r]\n\n                dist = diff[k] - diff[l]\n                pair_cost = dist if dist < x else x\n\n                total = pair_cost + inside + outside\n                if total < best:\n                    best = total\n\n            dp[l][r] = best\n\n    return dp[0][m - 1]\n```",
