      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef max_frequency_sum(nums):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the total number of occurrences of elements that appear with\n    the maximum frequency in the given list of positive integers.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Count frequencies\n    freq = {}\n    for num in nums:\n        freq[num] = freq.get(num, 0) + 1\n    \n    # Find the maximum frequency\n    max_freq = max(freq.values())\n    \n    # Sum the frequencies of all elements that have the maximum frequency\n    total = 0\n    for count in freq.values():\n        if count == max_freq:\n            total += count\n    \n    return total\n```",
