    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Although they disagreed with his personal infidelities, many Americans supported President Bill Clinton's position and policy decisions during his term in office. This dichotomy of opinion demonstrates a split in\n\nOptions: \nA. external locus of control\nB. situational ethics\nC. internal validity\nD. cognitive dissonance\nE. social desirability bias\nF. attitudinal coherence\nG. attributional bias\nH. moral relativism\nI. self-representation\nJ. behavioral consistency\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
