    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: If adverse impact on some minority group has been observed, which of the following types of tests probably has the best chance of withstanding legal challenge\n\nOptions: \nA. Projective\nB. Empirically keyed\nC. Personality test\nD. Multiple-choice\nE. Computer adaptive test\nF. Integrity test\nG. Work sample\nH. Situational judgement test\nI. Cognitive ability test\nJ. Polygraph test\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
