  {
    "global index": "MMLUPro_economics_6160",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A dark room technician who develops film into photographs loses his job because few people use film cameras any more. This is an example of which of the following?\n\nOptions: \nA. Seasonal unemployment\nB. Casual unemployment\nC. Cyclical unemployment\nD. Structural unemployment\nE. Underemployment\nF. Involuntary unemployment\nG. Technological unemployment\nH. Natural unemployment\nI. Frictional unemployment\nJ. Traditional unemployment\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash",
