      "generated_answer": "The characteristic equation for the AR(2) process $y_t = 1.5 y_{t-1} - 0.5 y_{t-2} + u_t$ is $1 - 1.5z + 0.5z^2 = 0$, which factors as $(1 - z)(1 - 0.5z) = 0$. The roots are $z_1 = 1$ and $z_2 = 2$; since there is a root exactly equal to 1, the process possesses a unit root. Because a unit root process does not have roots strictly outside the unit circle, it is by definition non-stationary.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
