    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Lyotard's dictum 'I define postmodern as incredulity toward meta-narratives' means:\n\nOptions: \nA. Postmodernism disregards individual stories.\nB. Universal values are meaningless.\nC. Literature reproduces repression.\nD. The concept of truth is objective and undeniable.\nE. The law is static.\nF. Individual stories are suspect.\nG. Postmodernism promotes the acceptance of all narratives.\nH. Postmodernism rejects all forms of authority.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
