    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is the function of \"standard-setting in human rights diplomacy?\n\nOptions: \nA. Standard-setting means putting forward binding legal standards\nB. Standard-setting means merely proposing binding legal standards\nC. Standard-setting means putting forward non-binding legal standards\nD. Standard-setting means setting certain standards of conduct in human rights treaties\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
