ecause the restaurant manager verbally agreed to the price increase.\nJ. Yes, because the price increase is minimal and doesn't significantly affect the restaurant's expenses.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
